 ## Unreleased
 
+- `Inventory.write_off(sku, qty, date=None)` records broken or damaged stock as a DAMAGE movement (goods out).
 - Command line: `python -m stockroom onhand SKU --log FILE` prints the quantity on hand;
   `python -m stockroom receive SKU QTY UNIT_COST --log FILE` appends a receipt (unit cost in cents);
   `python -m stockroom moves SKU --log FILE` prints each movement as date, reason and quantity, tab-separated.
